Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Background", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968753018344112*^9, 
  3.96875302029268*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5618337d-6921-41a3-a55c-\
de9a1bda520b"],

Cell["\<\
The integrated circuit (IC) operational amplifier (Op Amp) is the building \
block for many analog electronic circuits. They are used extensively in \
analog control systems and in sensor electronics. An operational amplifier is \
a very high gain amplifier with a pair of differential inputs (one positive \
and one negative). By feeding back the output of an op amp to its negative \
input in various ways (i.e. via combinations of capacitors, resistors and \
inductors) a remarkably wide range of capabilities can be achieved.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968753033022841*^9, 
  3.968753077936985*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3f5834de-a248-4e12-abeb-\
be6a424161df"],

