Cell["\<\
As you can see in this example (where the input is a sinusoid) the circuit \
sets all negative values of the input to zero (i.e., it only \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]passes\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] positive values).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968770340476108*^9, 
  3.968770347967053*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"32135924-2115-424f-8e68-\
bd699e6799f5"],

Cell["\<\
We can simply reverse the diodes the get the negative portion of the input \
waveform (i.e., it only
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]passes\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] negative values).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.968770368063559*^9},ExpressionUUID->"58c6ba28-e653-4ee3-a2e7-\
760eedb08c80"],

